{"id":"0c40d420e5118724","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","title":"Name Evaluation","display":"df-name-evaluation — Name Evaluation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-name-evaluation","aliases":["58-df-name-evaluation"],"display":"df-name-evaluation — Name Evaluation","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-name-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-name-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-name-evaluation — Name Evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\dot x,G,P\\in V\">\\(x,\\dot x,G,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{val}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\to\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot y):\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\dot y,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\to\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot y):\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\dot y,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\dot x,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\land x=\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\dot x,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\land x=\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Foundation makes the recursion well founded on the ranks of the names; the unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is conventionally written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x^G\">\\(\\dot x^G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Genericity is not needed to evaluate a name; it is needed when forming a forcing extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-name.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,\\dot x,G,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\to\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot y):\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\dot y,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\dot x,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\land x=\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot x^G","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"1e3f4af7bf60a629","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"196cc15aecc1c1ef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15bc9a2ed3c9c46d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2b1eb1c4731bbe8","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}$（名称解释，见 [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]）"},{"id":"2971a6afd81dd3d9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S$ (well-founded name evaluation, see [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]])"},{"id":"006f3fc193351ef4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"e